Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 23:21:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] runtime: prefix "runtime error:" to PanicNilError.Error to
 fully confirm as runtime.Error

This change adds "runtime error:" to runtime.PanicNilError's Error method
to uniquely distinguish from other errors and to correctly conform to runtime.Error.

10 years ago in CL 21214, I added runtime.plainError to help correctly conform
runtime panics to the Go specification and it is only right and about time to add
this prefix to PanicNilError introduced 3 years ago in CL 461956.

Fixes #63813

